        <mxCell id="784bLGKqiE0oy2VdMyuQ-29" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;ESP32Can.CANWriteFrame(&amp;amp;reverseMsg);&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-left: 8px; margin-right: 8px;&quot;&gt;Reads the reverse signal pin from the drive selector using &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;digitalRead&lt;/font&gt; and writes the current state of the reverser to the CAN bus&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
